:: Temple Confess Self Sydney Cross []
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<set $location to 'temple'>>
<<temple_effects>>
<<effects>>
<<npc Sydney>>
<<person1>>
<<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>

<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You leave your own compartment and quietly close its heavy door. After checking that the corridor is empty, you open the other door
    and enter the confessor's side where Sydney is waiting.
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      Sydney glances toward the corridor and moves aside to make room on the bench. "You came all the way around?" <<he>> whispers. "We should keep our voices down."
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      Sydney stares at you, flushed from ear to ear. "Y-you actually came over here? We shouldn't... not in the confessional..." <<He>> gestures toward the bench beside <<him>>. "<span class='teal'>But please don't leave.</span>"
    <<else>>
      Sydney glances down the corridor, then leaves the door unlatched. "This is a terrible place to be alone together," <<he>> murmurs, making room for you beside <<him>>.
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你离开自己的隔间，悄悄关上沉重的门。确认走廊里没有人后，你打开另一扇门，进入悉尼所在的告解员一侧。
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      悉尼看了看走廊，又在长椅上为你让出位置。“你真的绕过来了？”<<he>>轻声说，“我们说话得小声些。”
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      悉尼盯着你，脸一直红到耳根。“你、你真的过来了？我们不应该……不能在告解室里……”<<he>>示意你坐到身边。“<span class='teal'>但请别离开。</span>”
    <<else>>
      悉尼朝走廊看了一眼，没有把门闩上。“这里实在不适合单独待着。”<<he>>低声说，在身旁为你让出位置。
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<<if _sydneyChastity and $sydneyChastityKnown>>
  <br><br><span class='teal'>
    <<lanSwitch "Sydney shifts on the narrow bench. Your hand touches the familiar clasp beneath Sydney's robe, and Sydney holds your gaze." '悉尼在狭窄的长椅上挪了挪。你的手隔着修道袍碰到熟悉的搭扣。悉尼迎上你的目光。'>>
  </span>
<<elseif _sydneyChastity>>
  <br><br><span class='lewd'>
    <<lanSwitch "You feel something firm beneath Sydney's robe. Sydney goes still for a moment, then reaches for your hand again." '你隔着悉尼的修道袍碰到一件硬物。悉尼僵了一瞬，又握住你的手。'>>
  </span>
<<elseif $sydneyChastityKnown>>
  <br><br><span class='teal'>
    <<lanSwitch "Sydney's waist is free of the clasp you remember. Sydney leans closer on the bench." '悉尼腰间已经没有你记得的搭扣。悉尼在长椅上朝你靠近。'>>
  </span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

