:: Temple Confess Self Sydney Interrupted Wait []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You hold still beneath Sydney's hand. The penitent admits to stealing from a collection plate and spending the money before guilt brought them here.
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      Sydney's trembling eases as <<he>> listens. <<He>> asks the penitent to return what they can and repair the harm with honest work. The answer is gentle, but not empty. By the time the stranger thanks <<him>>, Sydney sounds like a confessor again.
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      Sydney keeps you pinned against <<him>> while calmly prescribing restitution. The contrast between <<his>> solemn voice and heated body makes <<his>> final blessing shake.
    <<else>>
      Sydney gives practical counsel in a careful whisper. The stranger's breathing steadies, unaware that Sydney is holding you as tightly as the wooden screen.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    The penitent thanks Sydney and leaves. You remain silent until the outer footsteps fade.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你在悉尼手掌下保持不动。那名忏悔者承认自己从捐款盘里偷了钱，又在愧疚驱使其来到这里前把钱花掉了。
    <br><br>
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      悉尼听着对方的话，身体渐渐不再发抖。<<He>>劝对方尽力归还钱财，并用诚实劳动弥补造成的伤害。回答温和，却并不空洞。陌生人向<<him>>道谢时，悉尼听起来又像一名真正的告解者了。
    <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
      悉尼仍把你紧按在<<him>>身上，语气却平静地要求对方偿还损失。庄重的声音与滚烫的身体形成鲜明反差，令<<his>>最后一句祝祷微微发颤。
    <<else>>
      悉尼以谨慎的低语给出实际建议。陌生人的呼吸逐渐平稳，完全不知道悉尼抱你抱得和那道木板一样紧。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    忏悔者向悉尼道谢后离开。你们保持安静，直到门外的脚步彻底远去。
<</language>>
